    "kicker": "Apply the terms: was MOVEit a zero-day?",
    "fullText": "MOVEit Transfer is software companies use to send files securely. Cl0p began exploiting a flaw in it, CVE-2023-34362, around May 27, 2023. Progress Software released a patch on May 31. The flaw scored 9.8 out of 10.\n\nBecause attackers used the flaw before any fix existed, it was a zero-day. Emsisoft counted 2,773 affected organizations and 95,788,491 people as of June 28, 2024, though some may be double counted.",
